  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture/Food Production Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Pa Tavytera RekoPave in Paraguay (APTR) will work with 17 indigenous communities in Northern Paraguay to improve their agricultural production and cultivation of traditional seeds to become more food secure, protect their local environment, strengthen their cultural identity, and enhance the associations ability to represent its interests and advocate for its rights under Paraguayan law. Approximately 1,500 people will benefit directly and 5,200 people will benefit indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
